WEBVTT

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.160
Xuanzheng Year 23, Year of the Goat.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.600
Qinghe Nie Clan, Gusu Lan Clan,

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.770
Lanling Jin Clan, and Yunmeng Jiang Clan

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:59.510
led tens of thousands of cultivators to storm the Nightless City.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.770
The fierce battle went on for several weeks,

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.730
yet, the city would not fall.

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.620
Know your place.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.040
Wen Ruohan!

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.260
You...

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.330
Clan Leader, Zewu-Jun has arrived.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:52.680
Bring him in.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.400
Second Brother.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.010
A-Yao.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.110
You must be tired after such an arduous journey.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:14.360
By the looks of it, you must have stayed up late working again last night.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.740
I'm not talented.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.300
It was only thanks to everyone's kindness that I was elected as the Chief Cultivator.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.050
I must give it all I've got.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.360
A-Yao, do not think lightly of yourself.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.500
Your contribution was critical in the Sunshot Campaign.

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:34.020
Had it not been for your assassination of Wen Ruohan back then,

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:37.630
tens of thousands more people would have died in the great battle.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.660
Second Brother, you're too kind.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:44.280
Think nothing of it. You're always so humble.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.900
I heard that you plan to deploy men and raise funds from all clans

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.980
to build 2000 more Watch Towers.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.940
The cultivation clans rarely live in remote areas

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.990
where evil beings tend to cause the most trouble.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.100
The Watch Towers will be manned by all clans in turn.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.260
They will be able to give warnings in time.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:06.570
The previous batch only covered limited regions.

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.500
I hope that by adding these new ones,

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:11.610
fewer commoners will suffer from malicious fiends.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.420
Back then,

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.980
many people questioned whether it was just an excuse to line your own pockets.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:24.780
Although the Watch Towers have been quite effective for the past 5 years,

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:30.360
an additional batch of 2000 will raise even more criticism.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.980
It doesn't matter as long as my conscience is clear.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:38.060
Besides, you've got my back, right?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.220
The three of us became sworn brothers

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:46.260
with the utmost wish of restoring peace to the world.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.980
Eldest Brother passed away in his prime and couldn't see his wish fulfilled.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.700
Now, you've devoted your whole heart to the public.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.870
Naturally, I should support you with all my might,

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.380
just like how Eldest Brother would have done.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:01.020
I'm deeply grateful to you, Second Brother.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.520
It's almost time for the anniversary of Eldest Brother's passing.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.160
Several days ago, Huaisang sent a letter

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.250
asking when we plan to depart for the Unclean Realm*

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.630
so he could start preparing.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:15.300
The arrangements for the Discussion Conference are almost finished on my end.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.780
I can set out at any time.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:18.980
How about you?

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.900
There is no urgent business at the Cloud Recesses either,

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:27.020
aside from the severed arm Wangji brought back from his night hunt in Mt. Dafan.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.540
Its extreme ferocity is rarely seen.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.380
A severed arm? Where did it come from?

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.740
We don't know yet.

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:39.180
Before I left, I put Wangji in charge of all matters at the Cloud Recesses.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.280
No need to worry.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:02.580
Back then, Lan Zhan always wanted to bring me here to dissolve my cultivation.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:06.620
Why is he so lenient with this Mo Xuanyu, who was also a demonic cultivator?

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:12.200
Hope it won't be my turn after he finishes dealing with the ghost hand tonight.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.580
Better sneak away while I can.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.330
Since when has Lan Zhan picked up the hobby of making flutes?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:24.140
The wine and the flute are both mine now.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.740
Little Apple, let's go!

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:34.170
Come on, Little Apple!

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.020
You actually <i>like</i> staying in this boring place?

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.540
The protective barrier of the Cloud Recesses is well-guarded.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:43.210
It will be troublesome without a token for passage.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.380
I need to think of something.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.560
<i>Someone is here alone. This is my opportunity.</i>

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:12.700
<i>Scars from a discipline whip?</i>

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.190
<i>So many strikes?!</i>

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.520
<i>Just what monstrous crime did he commit?</i>

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.480
Piece of cake.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.640
Lan Zhan?!

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:01.820
I... just found this token when I was passing by.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.520
I was about to give it back.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.480
Han... Hanguang-Jun.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.820
Hold on! I didn't mean to watch you bathe!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:14.090
<i>I'm screwed. Will I get another beating for this?</i>

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.640
<i>This scar...?!</i>

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.140
Hanguang-Jun! Bad news!

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:28.330
The ghost hand released a burst of resentful energy.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.950
The elders can't suppress it any longer.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.930
It's already been almost 2 hours since Hanguang-Jun went in.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.880
How come the bell still keeps tolling?

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.390
Its resentful energy is even stronger than when it was in Mo Village!

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:19.260
How...?

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:22.700
This has never happened during an Evocation in the Obscure Room.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.040
Young Master Mo, don't go there!

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.120
Open!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.620
What a lunatic!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.050
Why does the gate of the Obscure Room take orders from you?!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.670
Stop playing!

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.920
A sliver of soul still remains in the ghost hand.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.120
It's impossible for the Evocation to fail.

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:46.820
Unless...

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:52.810
The soul of this hand's owner has been cut apart along with its corpse.

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:56.000
Dismembered body, shattered soul?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.840
Just how much fierce hatred could the culprit have?

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:00.300
Hanguang-Jun!

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.360
Take the elders out for healing now.

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:03.280
Understood!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.460
Interesting.

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.350
You... you're not injured?!

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.260
I thought you would...

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.570
What are you saying?

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:17.880
Wangji, who is that Young Master?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.700
Uncle, he is...

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.240
Mo Xuanyu, Young Master Mo.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:28.890
This Young Master Mo has an impressive cultivation base.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.920
You think that this hand is odd?

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:36.160
It's very likely that this hand was targeted at our clan.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.120
How so?

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:41.100
The Spirit Lure Flags that we drew in Mo Village

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.290
had an effective radius of only 2 miles.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.610
Due to the ferocity of this hand, if it had been in range before,

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.700
Mo Village would have been drenched in blood.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:53.480
Therefore, it only appeared after we arrived.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:55.580
In other words,

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.620
a malicious person had deliberately chosen that point in time

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.950
to toss the hand there.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:07.340
In that case, we're probably responsible for the victims in Mo Village...

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.440
No, you're not.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.990
But the one who released the ghost hand is.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.280
Any new leads?

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.800
Soul Expel Seal, a skill of demonic cultivation,

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:25.180
specially used to keep one's soul out of his body.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.830
As one can see from this seal,

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.350
our spell caster, who dismembered someone's body and soul,

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.860
must be a top-notch expert.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.090
Can you undo this?

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.180
Of course!

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.990
But I'm no match for those who refined demonic cultivation.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.520
It will take a lot of time to undo the seal.

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:45.420
<i>Mo Xuanyu specifically summoned me when he offered his body.</i>

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.450
<i>This ghost hand just happened to appear in the vicinity.</i>

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.490
<i>Then Wen Ning came...</i>

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.640
<i>Looks like</i>

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:57.180
<i>someone is unwilling to let me rest in peace, even if I had been dead for years.</i>

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.140
Are my eyes playing tricks on me?

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.910
Did the hand just move?

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.680
Hanguang-Jun!

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.760
Abnormal resentful energy has been found in many Watch Towers!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:17.700
Support needed!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:18.520
When?

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.240
Around midnight.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:24.120
All in remote haunted districts, no further than 150 miles away from Cloud Recesses.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:27.210
Evocation of the ghost hand caused a surge of resentful energy.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.360
Evil territories resonated together.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:32.480
These places might be related to the hand.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.960
Pass on my order: send 20 disciples to each location.

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.040
Understood!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:41.320
I will leave tomorrow to find leads about the ghost hand.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.640
But there are so many places, where will you start?

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:47.180
That's easy!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.760
We'll start from...

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:51.800
where it's pointing at.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.090
The ghost hand pointed North-East. It should be around here.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:54.160
I don't sense much abnormal resentful energy here though.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:44.760
Why are you tailing us?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.390
Forgive me, Hanguang-Jun!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.690
I heard that the resentful energy here is surging.

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:51.850
I'm here... for the treasure.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.800
Treasure? What treasure?

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.800
As a demonic cultivator,

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.990
I naturally wish to find the Yiling Patriarch's treasure.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:09.950
Legend has it that

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.820
the Ghost General, Stygian Tiger Amulet, Chenqing Flute, and Demonic Manuscripts

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.640
were all destroyed over 10 years ago.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:19.770
And yet, a few days ago, the Ghost General appeared at Mt. Dafan.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:23.400
Perhaps the other treasures still exist.

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:32.170
You think that the Yiling Patriarch's treasures might be left in this mountain?

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:35.440
Since they're treasures, surely they won't be easy to get.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.720
However, I've asked around.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.560
Something weird <i>did</i> happen here.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:46.590
11 years ago, folks from several villages around here disappeared one after another.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:50.110
The nearby forest kept making queer noises.

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:52.580
People who scouted around never returned.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:54.300
Many villagers moved out.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:59.210
A few months later, people stopped going missing, and the noises also ceased.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:03.820
But 2 days ago, the noises suddenly started again.

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.560
She's a pitiable one...

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:16.890
Pardon me, what do you mean?

00:22:17.610 --> 00:22:23.020
11 years ago, she was the only one who made it back alive.

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:26.430
Unfortunately, she went mad.

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.800
Nobody knows what she had seen.

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:36.570
Yin Shi Fifth Watch*.

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:39.720
Evil be gone.

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:46.640
Seems like that woman did witness something in the mountain.
